# Parts Specification: Stage 2 Turbocharger Kit

**SKU:** GT2860RS-KIT

**Part ID:** 101

**Category:** Forced Induction

**Manufacturer:** Garrett Performance

## Compatibility

Fits 2.0L–2.5L inline-4 turbo-capable engine blocks with a factory or aftermarket oil cooler provision.

Requires the factory downpipe to be removed before fitment (see `part_id 104`).

Not compatible with vehicles still running the factory ECU map. An ECU tune (`part_id 103`) is required after installation, otherwise the engine will run dangerously lean under boost.

Not compatible with the factory intercooler piping. A front-mount intercooler (`part_id 102`) with matching flange size is required.

## Torque Specs

- **Turbo-to-manifold flange nuts:** 35 Nm, tightened in a star pattern.
- **Oil feed banjo bolt:** 20 Nm.
- **Oil return flange bolts:** 10 Nm.
- **Compressor housing clamp:** 25 Nm.
- Re-check all fasteners after the first 100 km of driving.

## Installation Order

**Install After:** None.

This is the first component installed — everything else attaches to or depends on the turbo being in place.

## Special Instructions

Prime the oil feed line before first start by cranking with the fuel pump disabled for 10 seconds to avoid dry-starting the turbo bearings.